      "omegaBannerUrl": "",
      "readmeExcerpt": "# DMU Mits\n\nDMU Mits is a planned Dalamud plugin for mitigation planning during DMU.\n\nThe plugin shows a compact list of upcoming DMU mechanics with mitigation callouts from a baked timeline.\n\nCurrent local build:\n\n- Phase-local timers with a once-per-second sync loop while inside DMU.\n- Cast/status/object-table sync points to keep the active phase timer aligned.\n- A compact upcoming-mechanic bar list sorted soonest first, including timeline-only mechanics with no assigned mitigation.\n- A top mitigation callout based on the local player's assigned slot.\n- Party slot assignment settings for MT, OT, healer jobs, and D1-D4, with auto-sort plus manual reassignment.\n- Additional timeline-only mechanics are derived from the ACT/cactbot Dancing Mad timeline, with mitigation rows linked onto their matching mechanic timings.\n\nPuni setup will be added later.",
      "title": "dmu-mits",
      "url": "https://github.com/Nainaiowo/dmu-mits"
    }
  },
